{"id":"n14141-1-7","stage":2,"title":"예보 · 预报","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14141-1-7-1","ko":"민준아, 오늘 날씨 예보 봤어?","zh":"敏俊，你看了今天的天气预报吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예보","meaning":"预报","explanation":"예보：预报","readings":[{"term":"예보","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14141","senseId":"1","lemma":"예보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看、查看（这里指看天气预报）","explanation":"보다：看、查看（这里指看天气预报）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"e42802dfc8235a40","term":"예보","zh":"预报","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3","entryId":"14141","definition":"提前报道以后要发生的事；或指那样的报道。","pronunciation":["예ː보"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看、查看（这里指看天气预报）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"看、查看（这里指看天气预报）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc0a5044da4971fb35fc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14141-1-7-2","ko":"응. 오늘은 하루 종일 맑대.","zh":"嗯，说今天一整天都会是晴天。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一整天","explanation":"종일：整天，一整天","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91759","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맑대.","meaning":"晴朗，明朗","explanation":"맑다：晴朗，明朗；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"2","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一整天","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91759","definition":"从早晨到夜晚一直。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"晴朗，明朗","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definition":"没有云雾，天气很好。","pronunciation":["막따"]}],"audio":"/audio/341f4ba2169a671a3015.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14141","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.5385,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，说今天一整天都会是晴天。","敏俊，你看了今天的天气预报吗？","亲爱的，我去医院检查，说是怀孕了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊，你看了今天的天气预报吗？","亲爱的，我去医院检查，说是怀孕了。","嗯，说今天一整天都会是晴天。"],"answer":2}]}
